{"info": {"_postman_id": "1d0e9fe2-10e2-44db-a640-b85e41b42ff2", "name": "Chronos-API", "description": "Collection completa da API Chronos Pomodoro.\n\nFluxo recomendado:\n1. Cadastrar \u2192 2. Login (captura o token automaticamente) \u2192 3. Usar as demais rotas normalmente.", "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json", "_exporter_id": "47581431"}, "variable": [{"key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3333", "type": "string"}, {"key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string"}], "item": [{"name": "\ud83d\udd13 Auth", "item": [{"name": "Cadastrar usu\u00e1rio", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Denys Wenceslau\",\n  \"email\": \"denys.wenceslau@iesb.edu.br\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"]}, "description": "Cria uma nova conta. Senha \u00e9 salva com hash seguro (scrypt). Retorna os dados do usu\u00e1rio criado (sem senha)."}, "response": []}, {"name": "Login", "event": [{"listen": "test", "script": {"exec": ["const json = pm.response.json();", "if (json.token) {", "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);", "  console.log('\u2705 Token salvo na vari\u00e1vel {{token}}');", "}"], "type": "text/javascript"}}], "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"denys.wenceslau@iesb.edu.br\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"]}, "description": "Faz login e retorna um token JWT. O token \u00e9 salvo automaticamente na vari\u00e1vel {{token}} da collection \u2014 todas as rotas protegidas j\u00e1 o utilizam."}, "response": []}, {"name": "Meu perfil (me)", "request": {"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string"}]}, "method": "GET", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"]}, "description": "Retorna os dados do usu\u00e1rio autenticado a partir do token JWT."}, "response": []}, {"name": "Esqueci minha senha", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"denys.wenceslau@iesb.edu.br\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]}, "description": "Solicita redefini\u00e7\u00e3o de senha. Em ambiente de laborat\u00f3rio, o campo 'devToken' \u00e9 retornado na resposta para facilitar os testes. Em produ\u00e7\u00e3o, seria enviado por e-mail."}, "response": []}, {"name": "Redefinir senha", "request": {"method": "POST", "header": [{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text"}], "body": {"mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"COLE_AQUI_O_devToken_RECEBIDO\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"nova_senha_123\"\n}", "options": {"raw": {"language": "json"}}}, "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "reset-password"]}, "description": "Redefine a senha usando o token recebido em 'Esqueci minha senha'. O token expira em 1 hora e s\u00f3 pode ser usado uma vez."}, "response": []}, {"name": "Logout", "request": {"auth": {"type": "bearer", "bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string"}]}, "method": "POST", "header": [], "url": {"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"]}, "description": "Encerra a sess\u00e3o. Como o JWT \u00e9 stateless, o logout real acontece no cliente descartando o token."}, "response": []}]}, {"name": "\u2699\ufe0